evolution-groupwise (0.8.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Sent Items: Delivery Status… shows what happened at each recipient
    (delivered, opened, deleted, accepted …); Retract… takes messages
    back from the recipients; Resend… opens a message to send it anew
    and asks whether the original is retracted.
  * The follow-up flag of a mail is the GroupWise Tasklist, both ways,
    with due date and completion.
  * Tasks: a completed task starts on the day it was given.
  * Junk Mail settings: the context menu of a list moves entries onto
    the other lists.

