evolution-groupwise (0.7.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Appointment editor: tab Travel Time with the red car of the GroupWise
    client — preparation and travel time before and after an appointment;
    set, changed and taken away as in the GroupWise client, the user's own
    (not sent to attendees). Moving an appointment takes it along.
  * New meetings have the owner of the calendar as an accepted attendee,
    as in the GroupWise client; sent meetings show with their own copy.
  * Saving an appointment warns about busy time it overlaps in the own
    calendars, travel times included.
  * Meetings the user takes part in show once, not again in proxy
    calendars; the tooltip names the owner of proxy appointments and the
    attendees' answers.
  * Resources are invited like attendees, with their name; a place gives
    a meeting without location its name as location.

